This repository contains components under different licenses.

driver/if_agnic: BSD-2-Clause, derived from The Mamoru Project and selected
XGS126 work by Michael Piorkowski. Preserve individual file notices.
npu/firmware/forwarder.c: Marvell's original multi-license header is retained;
this project uses the GPL-2.0 option.
npu/firmware/tag_dsa.h: GPL-2.0-or-later; see its provenance notice.
Other imported NPU helper sources: MIT unless their file header says otherwise.
New integration, build scripts, installer and tests: MIT, copyright (c) 2026
XGS116 integration contributors. Documentation added for this integration: MIT.
MUSDK is fetched separately at a pinned commit and retains its own licensing.

Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Source references and selected modifications
are documented in docs/SOURCE-REFERENCES.md and component documentation.
Distribution of dp_fwd must include its corresponding source, including the
pinned MUSDK tree, modifications, build scripts and applicable license texts.

No license is newly assigned here to the pre-existing current/, phases/,
captures/ or other historical research files. Consult their existing notices
and original authors before redistribution.

Sophos firmware, bootloader, vendor modules, original private backups and keys
are not distributed or relicensed by this project.
